ss at 40 s on this map). Found: the last stage's portal is Megabonk's `InteractableBossSpawnerFinal`. Melty test with 0.5.0. Melty test `f40eeddc` of 0.5.0 passed (3 runs: Lumbridge, Morytania, TzHaar City with the Fight Caves and Jad). The first 0.5.0 test (`f9cc7928`) failed its TzHaar run on `evolution` alone: the test casket landed in the final portal's stage reload (fixed in `f1c619d`). |\n| <span class=\"st st-done\">done</span> | **Underground and instance arenas** | Decided (the milestone plan): **TzHaar first**, TzHaar City as the Desert's third stage and the Fight Caves as its boss arena. The boss-arena mechanism already exists: since 0.2.10 summoning the Giant Mole moves the fight into the Falador Mole Lair (`bosses.osrs_arena`, `Arena.BossSummoned`), so 0.5 extends it to a portal into a separate arena with its own waves and Megabonk's stage end. Later arenas: the Kalphite Queen's lair (0.8), the KBD lair (0.9), the God Wars generals' rooms (0.11). Built, not yet run with its rows: `Systems/BossFight.cs` (arena waves and the held boss, scripted attacks, healers), the columns `arena_waves`, `boss_at`, `attack_every_ms`, `healers`, `prayer_blocks_fully` and `maps.underground` (`eb1f34a`); regression unchanged. The rows come from the pipeline session's 0.5 staging. Run with its rows: the Fight Caves arena, waves on time, Jad held then released after the waves, his scripted attacks landing in their style (scenario `fight-caves`). Melty test `f40eeddc` of 0.5.0 passed (3 runs: Lumbridge, Morytania, TzHaar City with the Fight Caves and Jad). |\n| <span class=\"st st-done\">done</span> | **Jad's attacks in the sheet** | The pipeline's staging merged (`a651437`): Magic (2656, spotanims 447 launch and 448 flight), Ranged (2652, the 451 boulder on the target) and the Bite (2655, beside him only), one at random every 4.8 s, landing 3.1 s after the wind-up; the right protection prayer blocks them fully. Autoplay prays on the wind-up, as a player does. Melty test `f40